Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,stuff
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.33,0:00:08.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing, Dobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.85,0:00:12.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm making decorations out of this pretty paper!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.24,0:00:15.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, that's the paper the landlady bought.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.07,0:00:21.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, Chitose bought it at the gift shop downtown. She said to give it to everyone at Yomogi Nursery.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.12,0:00:26.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll make plenty of these and decorate the windows and doors!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.01,0:00:29.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone will be so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.00,0:00:31.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, they'll just be irritated.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.15,0:00:35.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Lemme tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.72,0:00:37.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's origami paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.88,0:00:40.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're supposed to fold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.02,0:00:46.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What do I do, Ioryogi!?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.48,0:00:49.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't change it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.76,0:00:51.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.55,0:00:53.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're such a cut-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.67,0:00:56.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There ain't no putting it back together!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.58,0:02:35.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.25,0:02:45.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.91,0:02:50.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka, you don't look quite right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.73,0:02:52.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You look worn out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.30,0:02:53.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.94,0:02:56.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You don't tell women they look worn out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.91,0:02:58.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You'll hurt their feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.30,0:02:59.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not joking around!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.78,0:03:05.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm bringing this to the office now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.54,0:03:07.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.32,0:03:18.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um, Miss Sayaka...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.82,0:03:20.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.54,0:03:23.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.33,0:03:25.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.53,0:03:30.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Chitose said this was for everyone at Yomogi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.91,0:03:33.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, origami paper!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.39,0:03:34.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's so much of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.81,0:03:38.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There used to be even more...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.19,0:03:43.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't know origami paper was for folding, and kinda messed up...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.48,0:03:45.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.74,0:03:53.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.75,0:03:58.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka! Miss Sayaka!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.00,0:04:01.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto! Fujimoto!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.91,0:04:02.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.76,0:04:04.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's Miss Sayaka!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.99,0:04:09.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.02,0:04:10.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's get you to the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.64,0:04:12.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I said I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.86,0:04:14.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's no way you're fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.59,0:04:19.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I am. Just let me rest a little and I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.23,0:04:22.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I know a doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.52,0:04:24.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll go get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.20,0:04:32.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.82,0:04:35.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato! Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.10,0:04:50.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.43,0:04:53.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me! Please come to the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.53,0:04:57.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please come to the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.52,0:04:59.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.73,0:05:00.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.95,0:05:02.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Where's Shuichiro?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.80,0:05:08.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Help me! Miss Sayaka is{\fscx162}-{\fscx81}!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.32,0:05:09.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.53,0:05:29.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong with Miss Sayaka?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.49,0:05:32.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You don't need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.27,0:05:40.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's the diagnosis?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.49,0:05:44.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Exhaustion from lack of sleep, complicated by a minor case of gastritis.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.79,0:05:46.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.45,0:05:50.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll write a prescription.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.69,0:05:54.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Once she gets some rest, feed her something easy on the stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.00,0:05:55.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.65,0:05:58.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry to call you so suddenly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.42,0:06:01.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, I enjoy a change of pace sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.92,0:06:03.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.17,0:06:05.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Will Miss Sayaka be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.09,0:06:11.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If she keeps this up, next time will be worse than just collapsing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.33,0:06:19.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I want you to tell her not to just write it off as exhaustion.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.83,0:06:20.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.89,0:06:24.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.02,0:06:26.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.16,0:06:36.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How do you know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.53,0:06:40.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He lives with Kohaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.24,0:06:41.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kohaku?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.72,0:06:43.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, that lady from before?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.64,0:06:44.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.63,0:06:58.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.71,0:07:03.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is Miss Sayaka sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.48,0:07:07.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.76,0:07:08.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.36,0:07:12.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. The doctor said she'll get better soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.41,0:07:20.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you don't cheer up, she'll be worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.46,0:07:29.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's sing so she gets better.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.76,0:07:31.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.95,0:07:47.19,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Under the blue, blue sky
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.40,0:07:47.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato completely forgot about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.19,0:07:52.08,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Outside in the...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.22,0:08:11.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.02,0:08:12.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.90,0:08:17.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you think just sitting here watching will make her better?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.43,0:08:20.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I just want to stay a little longer...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.87,0:08:22.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Grow up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.63,0:08:26.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You should be looking after the kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.98,0:08:30.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That would let her rest easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.77,0:08:35.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.22,0:08:47.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So, how is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.37,0:08:48.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's resting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.04,0:08:51.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.45,0:08:52.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.23,0:08:56.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,See, if you do this{\fscx162}-{\fscx81}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.63,0:08:58.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A servant!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.78,0:09:04.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, so that's how you make origami.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.83,0:09:08.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Look, Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.64,0:09:12.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, a balloon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.77,0:09:15.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you making, Toshihiko?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.32,0:09:16.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Cranes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.16,0:09:18.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Cranes?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.59,0:09:20.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They're a bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.78,0:09:23.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I see, a bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.43,0:09:26.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're making a lot of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.05,0:09:27.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A thousand!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.18,0:09:30.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Eh? A thousand!?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.63,0:09:35.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. That way Miss Sayaka will get better soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.62,0:09:38.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you fold a thousand cranes, it cures someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.64,0:09:39.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Toshihiko!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.01,0:09:43.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Teach me how to fold cranes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.52,0:09:44.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll do it too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.95,0:09:46.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll fold cranes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.37,0:09:47.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.31,0:09:49.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's all fold them!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.42,0:09:52.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.00,0:09:53.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.04,0:09:56.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.38,0:09:59.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.87,0:10:02.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.54,0:10:08.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I made one!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.57,0:10:09.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.78,0:10:13.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Show me how!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.36,0:10:22.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if Kobato will be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.84,0:10:26.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Aren't you worrying about the wrong person?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.16,0:10:29.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.91,0:10:30.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.91,0:10:35.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,For some reason I'm worried about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.82,0:10:45.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Will Miss Sayaka be better tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.99,0:10:47.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She'll be fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.77,0:10:49.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,After all, we folded a thousand cranes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.92,0:10:51.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.59,0:11:04.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be back from work as soon as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.20,0:11:07.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Take care of Miss Sayaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.42,0:11:09.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.98,0:11:12.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Call me if anything happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.05,0:11:49.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Boss, I need to ask you a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.75,0:11:51.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What is it this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.68,0:11:56.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can I have fewer hours for a while?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.97,0:11:59.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you need the money?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.65,0:12:04.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, but right now there's something more important.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.30,0:12:07.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.15,0:12:12.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Keep in mind, when you have spare time again I'm gonna work you even harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.65,0:12:15.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.41,0:12:27.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.19,0:12:30.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.31,0:12:34.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Have you been here this whole time?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.49,0:12:35.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.71,0:12:38.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How are the kids?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.05,0:12:42.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone's already gone home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.64,0:12:43.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.02,0:12:46.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry to make you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.05,0:12:48.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please, rest more!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.67,0:12:57.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And here I was trying to cheer you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.95,0:13:06.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I never thought I'd feel relieved leaving things to you and Fujimoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.38,0:13:13.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If anything happens to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.79,0:13:17.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you saying that!?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.94,0:13:21.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That... That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.19,0:13:25.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If anything happens to you...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.04,0:13:26.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.49,0:13:29.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We'd be so sad!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.07,0:13:34.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So don't say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.82,0:13:42.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.79,0:14:00.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's enough for today. Go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.31,0:14:09.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're enough of an airhead at the best of times, we can't have you keeping her up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.40,0:14:10.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,An airhead!?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.77,0:14:12.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I am not!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.68,0:14:14.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll take over, you can go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.95,0:14:17.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.33,0:14:19.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Try not to space out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.22,0:14:20.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I told you, I'm not{\fscx162}-{\fscx81}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.55,0:14:21.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.85,0:14:29.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You got chewed out?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.99,0:14:31.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's his way of saying "good job".
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.45,0:14:33.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.95,0:14:35.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's just like she said.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.32,0:14:40.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All the kids helped fold.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.39,0:14:41.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.19,0:14:47.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,These are the ones she folded.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.35,0:14:49.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They're all like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.06,0:14:53.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She really is a good girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.06,0:15:21.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're that worried about Sayaka?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.50,0:15:24.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.05,0:15:30.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.83,0:15:31.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.81,0:15:40.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Could her memories be coming back?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.72,0:15:45.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Chiho, what's the answer to number 7?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.20,0:15:47.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Eh? You don't know either?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.22,0:15:55.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.32,0:15:56.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.68,0:15:59.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is Chitose here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.55,0:16:02.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mama went to the neighborhood meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.22,0:16:04.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.91,0:16:05.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.79,0:16:07.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You don't look good, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.04,0:16:10.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Someone's sick!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.65,0:16:14.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh no, Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.52,0:16:23.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's not me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.08,0:16:28.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka is sick!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.92,0:16:37.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I want to make something for Miss Sayaka, but I don't know what.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.06,0:16:42.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We all made her a thousand cranes, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.77,0:16:43.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A thousand cranes?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.21,0:16:44.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.54,0:16:48.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wasn't that good at making them, though...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.18,0:16:53.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What if it doesn't work because mine are no good?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.83,0:16:55.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.78,0:16:58.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure it'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.06,0:17:02.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I hope so...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.18,0:17:05.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I know! That!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.35,0:17:08.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What, that thing Mama always cooks when someone's sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.30,0:17:11.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rice gruel?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.44,0:17:12.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, rice gruel?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.73,0:17:13.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's it, rice gruel!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.30,0:17:20.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mama says rice gruel is easy on the stomach, so it's good when you're sick!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.57,0:17:22.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Easy on the stomach?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.33,0:17:24.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shuichiro mentioned that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.90,0:17:28.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He said to feed Miss Sayaka things that are easy on the stomach!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.19,0:17:31.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So let's make her some rice gruel!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.25,0:17:33.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, it'll make her feel better!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.05,0:17:37.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay! I'll make Miss Sayaka some rice gruel!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.53,0:17:40.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But how do I make it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.91,0:17:43.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's draw her instructions, Chiho!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.36,0:17:44.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Great idea, Chise!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.33,0:17:50.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.42,0:17:52.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So this is rice gruel?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.26,0:17:54.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's white...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.93,0:17:57.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And it's kinda syrupy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.06,0:17:58.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.28,0:18:00.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Syrupy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.97,0:18:05.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mama says to be careful when you're eating it or you'll scald yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.64,0:18:07.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Steamy hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.78,0:18:09.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And when you make it...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.51,0:18:11.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You put a lot of water in!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.80,0:18:14.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Covered with water!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.95,0:18:17.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You gonna be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.30,0:18:57.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.95,0:19:05.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing!?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.17,0:19:09.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I thought I'd make her some rice gruel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.99,0:19:15.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I even got Chiho and Chise to teach me how.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.88,0:19:17.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But it didn't turn out that good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.07,0:19:24.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rice gruel's easy on the stomach, so it'll be good for Miss Sayaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.45,0:19:32.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,After you put in the rice, put in a lot of water.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.20,0:19:36.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then put it on the burner and wait until it boils.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.98,0:19:39.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,After that, you simmer it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.21,0:19:43.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, how did you even end up with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.08,0:19:48.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If she had any of it, she'd just get sicker.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.30,0:19:58.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, don't cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.62,0:20:02.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If Miss Sayaka dies...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.50,0:20:11.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It'll be okay. People don't die{when they are killed} that easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.97,0:20:13.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes they do!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.62,0:20:22.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Even little things can kill someone!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.97,0:20:26.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Did you have that happen to someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.40,0:20:33.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.62,0:20:36.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka isn't going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.48,0:20:49.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.56,0:20:59.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's great! I feel a lot better.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.12,0:21:02.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.91,0:21:04.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now I'm worried I'll overeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.35,0:21:07.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's tasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.86,0:21:10.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm just glad I could help out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.28,0:21:12.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I did most of the work.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.09,0:21:15.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.95,0:21:17.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.49,0:21:19.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.60,0:21:20.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Figured.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.28,0:21:30.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's not like you got any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.58,0:21:35.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Staring at it like that isn't going to help, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.22,0:21:36.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.04,0:21:39.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're a lot less unhappy about it than I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.44,0:21:41.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now that you mention it...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.19,0:21:44.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder why.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.45,0:21:52.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Since I broke down in front of Fujimoto,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.38,0:21:57.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,for some reason all the the memories I'd kept locked up are flooding out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.35,0:22:02.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I feel so warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.66,0:22:08.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing getting healed when you're supposed to heal people?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.66,0:22:12.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Getting healed?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.68,0:22:15.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.77,0:22:22.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.91,0:22:24.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.02,0:22:25.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.65,0:22:27.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's Miss Sayaka!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.99,0:22:29.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.06,0:22:30.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning, Miss Sayaka!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.91,0:22:31.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.66,0:22:33.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Did you get better?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.10,0:22:35.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.65,0:22:38.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I knew the thousand cranes would work.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.83,0:22:40.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning, Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.92,0:22:43.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.00,0:01:08.88,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,{95 after the first frame of ribbon}What shall I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.88,0:01:17.18,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even the obvious things are always so hard
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.18,0:01:26.98,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,I just want to grin when I'm happy, sing when I'm in love
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.48,0:01:32.78,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,They say my dreams will come true someday
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.78,0:01:40.53,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,but when will someday come? I can't wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.53,0:01:46.21,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Count one, two, three and spread my arms
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.21,0:01:51.42,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Gather the light to myself
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.42,0:01:57.72,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Where is it? Tell me what I can do
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.72,0:02:03.39,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if I'm hurt so much, even if I run so hard
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.39,0:02:10.10,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if I collapse crying over and over, I still
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.10,0:02:18.82,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,believe in my amazing future
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.54,0:02:33.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(500,1125)\pos(360,166)\c&HFFFFFF&}... Secret Wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.60,0:23:07.78,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,{14 into ED}People all want to fly
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.45,0:23:15.29,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,but they're cheated by gravity
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.87,0:23:23.29,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,everyone can really fly
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.88,0:23:31.93,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,She must be so unhappy because
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.26,0:23:42.94,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,she forgot her own shadow somewhere
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.31,0:23:45.65,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.19,0:23:54.07,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,If you tell me "thanks", if you say "thanks" and smile
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.07,0:24:01.17,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Going back and forth, we'll be happy
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.96,0:24:10.67,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,You'll be happy, there'll be nothing to worry about
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.76,0:24:14.85,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,As long as we're together
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.56,0:24:27.98,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,It's strange, I'm crying even though I'm happy
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.98,0:24:30.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(500,0)\pos(458,388)}... Mysterious Life-form.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.98,0:24:30.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(500,0)\pos(456,116)}Next episode
